window.products.push({"id":496652,"name":"Teavli Tea Thermos with Infuser | Double Wall Insulated Glass Bottle, 304 Stainless Steel Loose Tea Infuser, Elegant Wooden Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XXA8EE-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Tea Thermos with Infuser & Elegant Wood Lid. The Best Way to Drink Tea! High Quality / Built to Last This glass tea tumbler has a reinforced thicker bottom for protection. You will be pressing your lips up against quality Borosilicate glass! The mesh tea infuser is made of 304 stainless steel. The leak-proof cap is made of BPA-Free Plastic and Bamboo Wood. Keep it Piping Hot! A double wall insulated design! We have tested efficiency of the insulated glass bottle: With a sealed thermos, tea will stay hot for 1 hour and warm for 2 hours. The perfect tea tumbler for slow sipping or when you're on the move! Super Convenient Push the filter into the glass tea thermos until it snaps into place. You can drink with the filter in the cup. Just toss in loose leaf tea, add hot water, and steep!   Not to big not to small. Perfect 400ml/13.5oz size. This glass tea bottle fits most car cup holders. The bottom diameter is 2 ¾”. The full length of the cup with the cap on is 9”. The steel tea strainer is 2” tall and has a bottom diameter of 1 11/16”   Microwave Safe - You may use the glass to boil water in the microwave. The glass is 8 ¼” tall so you may like boiling water separate and pouring the water into the cup. We have found this to be the most efficient way to use the bottle. Two Method Filtration - Free Flowing Leaves or Full Filter. If you are drinking green tea and like it strong, we recommend having your leaves free flow. This allows your leaves to have a larger area to steep and you will receive the full extent of your tea leaves' flavor! Use the full (top and bottom) loose tea infuser when you want to further separate your leaves from your drink.   Enjoy Your Tea HOT While You're on the Go, with Your New Tea Infuser Thermos Accompanied by a Stylish Wooden Lid with Strainer Made of 304 Stainless Steel!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XXA8EE-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teavli","source_asin":"B018KSHMY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-496652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018KSHMY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018KSHMY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
