window.products.push({"id":496750,"name":"AirExtend HEPA Air Purifiers, Room Purifier with 3 Stage Filtration System, 24-Hour Timer, and 22dB Ultra-Quiet Sleep Mode, True Filter Removes 99.97%","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PRLt3gZCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Performance, Solid Choice. Featured with a powerful purification system, the air purifier is endowed with a CADR (Clean Air Delivery Rate) up to 200 m3/h, of which the higher the figure, the better its ability to purify the air. That’s to say, the air purifier will circulate the air of a 215 ft²/20m² room within 20 minutes. 3-Stage Filtration, All-Round Care. Built-in 3 stages of filtration system perfectly remove different types of particles from the air, of which a pre-filter layer is for large particles like hair & lint, a HEPA layer is for small particles like smoke, and a layer of activated carbon is to eliminate odors. Remove up to 99.97% of pet dander, smoke, dust, and other microbes, and return you with a fresh & clean living environment. 3-Level Fan Speed, 24-Hour Timer. There are three fan speed levels available for you to adjust the air-purifying speed. The AUTO mode helps the device control the speed automatically as the air quality changes. Set the timer from 1 to 24 hours, so you can breathe in the fresh air all night or right now after you step into the room. Ultra-Quiet Operation, Sleep Sound. Come with a considerate sleep mode, the HEPA air purifier operates with a low noise level of less than 22dB. You can barely hear the noise even in the quiet night, perfect for the bedroom, baby’s room, living room, and office. Shut off the light by pressing the Lights-Off button and enjoy the whole night’s sleep with no light but purified fresh air lingering in your room. Filter Replacsement: Depending on usage, the filters should be replaced every 6–8 months, you can buy new filters by searching \"B09WMG87VC\" , Please rest assured that each product has gone through strict quality inspection processes before delivery. If you have any problem, contact us and we’ll help you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PRLt3gZCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AirExtend","source_asin":"B09NBTHHF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-496750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBTHHF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBTHHF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
