window.products.push({"id":496947,"name":"Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted，Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser for Bathroom，Toothbrush Holders and Toothbrush Dispenser kit with 6 Toothbrush Slots 2 M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oXDcAobdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Toothbrush Holder】The wall mount toothbrush holder set has a rich and practical function, both as a toothbrush holder and as a toothpaste dispenser. The upper part of the toothbrush holder is designed with a storage tray, a drawer storage in the middle and a deep slot storage on the right side. The storage slot on the right side is even designed with drainage holes to avoid moisture and achieve dry storage. Magnetic cup, upside down design for effective dust protection, fast drainage. 【Healthy and save toothpaste】Toothbrush holder with automatic toothpaste dispenser is made of ABS environmental material, high temperature resistant, healthy and odorless, still as new for long time use. The toothpaste dispenser is made of flexible silicone, with a 0.47-inch threaded toothpaste connector that fits most toothpastes. The unique vacuum squeeze extraction design makes it easy to squeeze out the toothpaste in a quantitative manner, which is convenient and saves toothpaste. 【Practical and easy to clean】The tooth brush holder has a toothpaste automatic dispenser , which is also equipped with a toothpaste dust cover at the toothpaste dispenser interface, which is covered when not in use to avoid dust contamination of the toothpaste dispenser. The wall toothbrush holder can be easily disassembled for daily cleaning and maintenance! Wall-mounted toothbrush holder appearance simple and stylish, suitable for a variety of bathroom decoration style. It is a good product for home gift! 【Large capacity】No-drill toothbrush holder wall mounted with 2 toothpaste dispensers suitable for couples or family use. There is a large tray on top of the toothbrush holder for face wash, skin lotion and other supplies, a deep slot shelf on the right side for combs, razors and other items, a large storage drawer in the middle for lipstick and personal care products, 2 toothpaste slots, 2 upside down magnetic cups, and 6 dustproof toothbrush hangers. A large capacity bathroom organizer! 【Easy and firm installation】KINDOJIA wall mounted toothbrush holder storage set uses strong non-marking stickers, no drilling, wall-mounted installation, simple and convenient without hurting the wall and leaving marks. Please note that the strong stickers are only suitable for smooth surfaces such as tiles, glass walls or smooth wood. Not suitable for rough, such as painted surfaces, rough wallpaper walls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oXDcAobdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KINDOJIA","source_asin":"B09YMPR1GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-496947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YMPR1GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YMPR1GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
