window.products.push({"id":497001,"name":"VEVOR Commercial Ice Cream Machine, 20-30L/H Yield, 2+1 Flavors Soft Serve Machine w/Two 7L Hoppers 1.8L Cylinders Puffing Pre-Cooling Shortage Alarm,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1589.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FdWmHlwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"key Features20-30L/H Yield & Double 7L HoppersEquipped with double 7 L hoppers and 1.8 L cylinders, our soft serve ice cream maker can output 20-30 L per hour. The built-in counter intuitively shows the number of ice creams produced. Up to 300 servings are done in an hour.3 Flavors & 4 Distinct NozzlesHere, we offer 2 single flavors & 1 mixed flavor to satisfy the diverse demands of your customers. Also, 4 nozzles are provided to make your ice creams look different from others.Brand Compressor & Useful FunctionsThe 1200W compressor and the refrigerant bring higher efficiency. The lack of raw materials can be detected. The pre-cooling function and integral foaming layer keep the mixtures fresh for longer.Feature-Rich Control PanelThe quantity of ice creams is directly displayed on the screen. Press down the buttons, and you can freely adjust the ice creams thicker or softer according to your taste. Auto refrigeration and one-click cleaning can also be activated.Thoughtful Product DetailsThe lid perfectly fits the mix hopper and keeps dust out of the mixtures. 3 handles are comfortable to grip and effortless to press down. The detachable tray collects the dripping ice creams. And 4 caster wheels are convenient for moving.Perfect for Various PlacesThis commercial soft serve ice cream machine is widely applied in snack bars, cafés, drink shops, restaurants, bakeries, buffets, fast food chains, and so on, meeting your daily commercial demands.SpecificationsModel: YKF-9228Color: SilverVoltage: 110V/60HzTotal Power: 2450WIce Cream Output: 5.3-7.9 Gal/HHopper Capacity: 1.8 GalCylinder Capacity: 0.5 GalCompressor: 1200WProduct Dimensions: 21.3\"x26.6\"x53.5\"Product Weight: 294 lbsPackage Content1 x Soft Serve Ice Cream Machine1 x Cone Holder1 x Set of Installation Tools1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FdWmHlwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B09XHTD2P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-497001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XHTD2P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XHTD2P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
